THE CLASS: **a fix on disk is not a fix in the running process.** A24 for
processes — a digest pins which artifact, not what is in it; a commit pins which
file, not what is executing. And it is worse than A24 in one respect: **`git log`
cannot tell you which lanes have a fix**, because the evidence is a process start
time and nothing in the repo records one.

Detector, refusing 9 of 9 right now:

