  19  AGENT-1     | https://claude.ai/code/session_01Vrhmh2...
  14  ATTACKER-1  | unassigned-in-lane        <- mutually indistinguishable
   4  AGENT-1     | local, no URL assigned (this lane's spawn prompt carried none)
```

47 of 85 are a placeholder. `commit-msg.hook` v4 checked the trailer was PRESENT
and never read its value. **A28 — a field recorded but never read — inside the
gate whose entire purpose is that attribution is possible at all (H12).**

It bit today, not in theory: **two lanes signed `Atom: AGENT-1` seven minutes
apart** (`dd1942d` 12:55, `a6e467e` 13:02, mine). That is the exact collision the
field exists for, and it separated them only because one lane happened to hold a
