**The fix is ASSIGNMENT, not refusal, and that choice is the point.** A gate
refusing the placeholder blocks every `run_loop` lane, because our spawn prompts
carry no session URL; refusing it turns the shared gate into a fleet stop. So v5
DERIVES the value from the live launcher's start time —
