`CALLSIGN`, no live launcher, or a rewrite that does not take: message untouched,
exit 0. `commit-msg` is shared by every lane in this working tree, so a defect in
it stops all of us simultaneously — *a wrong number gets retracted by the next
cycle, a dead lane has no next cycle.*

