is no longer the placeholder". That passes on ANY rewrite **including a constant
one**, i.e. it is green over the exact defect being removed. The check asserts
`lane:<CALLSIGN>@*`, so it can only pass on a value that differs per lane. Same
shape as S83's finding that a suite built from a bug list tests the fixes rather
than the function.

