did with it is.

Four signals, all true, all about the wrapper and none about the work:
launcher pid alive · `.loop_lock.$CALLSIGN` held · `.heartbeat.$CALLSIGN` fresh
(18–362 s) · `peers.sh` ADDRESSABLE. `fails` in `run_loop.sh` was the only thing
in the system that knew, and it was a **shell local**: `git grep` for a reader
